# Prisma Data Model

- Keep Prisma schema changes aligned with the current MVP and architecture docs.
- Preserve `organization_id` unless a documented tenancy decision changes it.
- Prefer explicit migrations for persistent data changes.
- Update ADRs when a schema change carries long-lived architectural consequences.
- Keep Postgres as the system of record; do not introduce duplicate persistence paths casually.
